+## Authentication and roles
+
+Send `Authorization: Bearer <key>`. Keys live in the data as
+`apiKeys: [{ "key", "name", "role" }]`.
+
+- `viewer`: GET only.
+- `cook`: GET, plus `POST /recipes/:id/cook`, `POST /batches/:id/waste`,
+  `POST /temperatures` and `POST /stocktakes/:id/counts`.
+- `manager`: everything.
+
+A missing or unknown key is `401 unauthorized`; a known key without
+permission is `403 forbidden`. Every non-GET request with a known key
+appends `{ time, key, method, path, status }` to `audit` (`key` is the key's
+name). `GET /audit` lists the entries newest first (managers only).
+
+## Routes added
+
+- `GET /audit`: the audit trail.
+
 ## Errors

